return {
  {"g3:082b5184", "SCOTT: Howdy, {01}{05}!\\n\\nYou know how POKéMON can be found\\neverywhere?\\n\\nLike in the mountains, in the sea,\\nin tall grass anywhere?\\n\\nJust like POKéMON, you can find\\nTRAINERS everywhere, too.\\n\\nAs a result, I have to hurry\\neverywhere, too. Busy, busy!", "SCOTT: Oi, {01}{05}!\\n\\nVocê sabe que POKéMON pode ser\\nencontrado em muitos lugares?\\n\\nComo nas montanhas, no mar,\\nna grama alta em qualquer lugar?\\n\\nAssim como POKéMON, há também\\nvários TREINADORES.\\n\\nEntÃo, eu tenho que ir em todos\\nos lugares, também."},
  {"g3:082b5275", "SCOTT: I'm on ROUTE 119 right now.\\nIt's teeming with TRAINERS!\\n\\nIt's also overgrown with tall grass\\neverywhere, it seems.\\n\\nWalking around in shorts here\\nmakes me all ticklish!", "SCOTT:  Eu estou na ROUTE 119 agora.\\nÉ repleta de TREINADORES!\\n\\nTambém é coberto com grama alta\\nem toda parte, ao que parece.\\n\\nAndar por aÍ em shorts aqui\\nme faz toda cócegas!"},
  {"g3:082b5323", "SCOTT: Hi, hi, {01}{05}!\\n\\nHave you had the chance to climb\\nMT. PYRE?\\n\\nThe place is a memorial to POKéMON\\nthat have passed away.\\n\\nIt's somewhere every TRAINER\\nshould climb to the top of once.", "SCOTT: Oi, oi, {01}{05}!\\n\\nVocê já teve a chance de subir\\nMT. PIRA?\\n\\nO lugar é um memorial para POKéMON\\nque já passaram na terra.\\n\\nÉ um lugar que cada TREINADOR\\ndeveria subir ao topo uma vez."},
  {"g3:082b53db", "SCOTT: Hi, {01}{05}!\\n\\nI've been hearing about these odd\\ngangs being a nuisance.\\n\\nTEAM MAGMA and TEAM AQUA,\\nI think they were.\\n\\nI would think there'd be some\\nskilled TRAINERS among them.\\n\\n...But if they're thugs...", "SCOTT: Oi, {01}{05}!\\n\\nOuvir sobre algumas gangues\\nde ser um incômodo.\\n\\nEQUIPE MAGMA e EQUIPE AQUA,\\nAcho que sÃo eles.\\n\\nQueria imaginar que haveria algum\\nTREINADOR qualificado entre eles.\\n\\n...Mas, sÃo bandidos..."},
  {"g3:082b54a5", "SCOTT: Oh, hi, {01}{05}.\\n\\nMight there be tough TRAINERS\\nat the bottom of the sea?\\n\\nI can't go check for myself.\\nI can't swim, for one.\\n\\nAnd I don't raise POKéMON...", "SCOTT: Oh, oi, {01}{05}.\\n\\nDeve haver bons TREINADORES\\nno fundo do mar?\\n\\nEu nÃo posso conferir.\\nPara começar, porque nÃo sei nadar.\\n\\nE também, eu nÃo crio POKéMON..."},
  {"g3:082b5541", "SCOTT: Hi, hi, {01}{05}!\\n\\nYou know that you can challenge\\nthe POKéMON LEAGUE when you've\\n\\ncollected all the GYM BADGES?\\n\\nWith your talent, becoming the\\nCHAMPION isn't a pipe dream.\\n\\nBut did you know?\\nThere's somewhere even better.\\n\\nBut, that's all I'm willing to say\\nfor the time being.\\n\\nIt's something you can look\\nforward to.\\n\\nWhen you've won your way through\\nthe POKéMON LEAGUE into the HALL\\n\\nOF FAME!", "SCOTT: Oi, olá, {01}{05}!\\n\\nSabia que já pode participar da\\nLIGA POKéMON quando conseguir\\n\\ntodas as INSÍGNIA de GINÁSIO?\\n\\nBem, com seu talento, tornar-se\\nCAMPEÃO nÃo é um sonho.\\n\\nMas você sabia?\\nHá um lugar ainda melhor.\\n\\nBem, isso é tudo o que eu posso\\ndizer no momento.\\n\\nVocê é genial..., nunca perde,\\né muito incrÍvel.\\n\\nQuando ganhar a LIGA POKéMON,\\nvocê passará a fazer parte do\\n\\nfamoso HALL DA FAMA!"},
  {"g3:082b56ca", "... ... ... ... ... ...\\n... ... ... ... ... ...\\n\\nSCOTT appears to be out of\\nthe POKéNAV's service area...", "... ... ... ... ... ...\\n... ... ... ... ... ...\\n\\nParece que SCOTT está em uma\\nárea em que nÃo há sinal..."},
  {"g3:082b5719", "DAD: In RUSTBORO, there's a man\\nthat goes by the odd name of\\n\\nthe CUTTER.\\n\\nIf you're in the area, you should\\npay him a visit.", "DAD: In RUSTBORO, there's a man\\nthat goes by the odd name of\\n\\nthe CUTTER.\\n\\nIf you're in the area, you should\\npay him a visit."},
  {"g3:082b5795", "DAD: Hm... Little by little, but also\\nvery surely, you're getting\\n\\ntougher, {01}.\\n\\nThe stronger you get, the farther\\nand higher you soar from Mother\\n\\nand me...\\n\\nThis feeling is hard to explain.", "PAI: Hm... Pouco a pouco, mas\\ncertamente, você está ficando\\n\\nresistente, {01}.\\n\\nQuanto mais forte fica, mais\\ndistante e mais alto voa para\\n\\nlonge da MÃE e eu...\\n\\nSentimento difÍcil de explicar."},
  {"g3:082b584d", "DAD: I see...\\nYou've collected four GYM BADGES...\\n\\nThere's no avoiding it now.\\nWe will battle like I promised.\\n\\nCome anytime.\\nWe'll all be waiting for you!", "PAI: Eu sei...\\nVocê já obteve 4 INSÍGNIAS de GYM...\\n\\nNÃo há como evitar agora.\\nVamos lutar como eu prometi.\\n\\nVenha qualquer hora.\\nEstamos todos esperando!"},
  {"g3:082b58e3", "DAD: {01}! You'd better go visit\\nMother every so often.\\n\\nI'm going to remain here and\\nredouble my training.\\n\\nThe way of battling is deep\\nand unforgiving!", "PAI: {01}! É melhor você ir\\nvisitar sua MÃE de vez em quando.\\n\\nEu vou ficar aqui e redobrar\\no meu treino.\\n\\nPara deixar o combate profundo\\ne implacável!"},
  {"g3:082b5979", "DAD: Oh, hi, {01}!\\n\\nWhat's that? MAGMA EMBLEM?\\nI don't know what that's about.\\n\\nBut with a name like that, it may\\nbe somehow linked to a volcano!", "DAD: Oh, hi, {01}!\\n\\nWhat's that? MAGMA EMBLEM?\\nI don't know what that's about.\\n\\nBut with a name like that, it may\\nbe somehow linked to a volcano!"},
  {"g3:082b5a07", "DAD: Hiyah! Haah! Dwah!\\n\\n...Oh? {01}!\\n\\nYou caught me right in the middle\\nof a POKéMON training session!", "PAI: Hiyah! Uuuuaaa! Aaaah!\\n\\n...Oh? {01}!\\n\\nMe pegou bem no meio de uma sessÃo\\nde treinamento POKéMON!"},
  {"g3:082b5a69", "DAD: {01}!\\n\\nWho would've thought you'd become\\nthe POKéMON LEAGUE CHAMPION...\\n\\nOkay!\\nI won't be left behind!", "PAI: {01}!\\n\\nEu nunca pensei que\\nvocê poderia ganhar\\n\\na LIGA POKéMON...\\n\\nPois nÃo penso em\\nficar para trás!"},
  {"g3:082b5acf", "DAD: Hm? {01}?\\nWhat good timing!\\n\\nThis time, I'm going to challenge\\nyou to battle.\\n\\nI'm waiting in the PETALBURG GYM.\\nAccept my challenge anytime!", "PAI: Hm? {01}?\\nQue tempo bom!\\n\\nDesta vez, eu vou desafiar\\nvocê para a batalha.\\n\\nEu te espero no GYM de PETALBURG.\\nAceite meu desafio quando puder!"},
  {"g3:082b5b5e", "DAD: ...You amaze me, {01}.\\nHow much higher will you soar?", "PAI: ...Me surpreende,\\n{01}.\\n\\nAté onde você vai chegar?"},
  {"g3:082b5b95", "STEVEN: Hi, {01}{05}!\\n\\nHave you been to MAUVILLE\\nalready?\\n\\nYou should visit the BIKE SHOP\\nand get a MACH BIKE.\\n\\nThen, try exploring the GRANITE\\nCAVE thoroughly.\\n\\nYou may make a new discovery\\nthere.", "STEVEN: Oi, {01}{05}!\\n\\nVocê já foi lá em MAUVILLE?\\n\\nDeveria visitar a loja de bicicletas\\ne obter uma BICI CARRERA.\\n\\nEntÃo, tente explorar a\\nCAVERNA GRANITO.\\n\\nVocê pode fazer uma nova\\ndescoberta lá."},
  {"g3:082b5c53", "STEVEN: Hi, {01}{05}!\\n\\nI've met a lot of different\\nTRAINERS so far.\\n\\nBut you're one of a kind.\\nYou're not like anyone else.", "STEVEN: Oi, {01}{05}!\\n\\nEu conheci vários TREINADORES\\ndiferentes até agora.\\n\\nMas um do seu tipo.\\nNÃo vi em qualquer pessoa."},
  {"g3:082b5cc9", "STEVEN: Hi, {01}{05}!\\n\\nWhen you're on an adventure with\\nyour POKéMON, what do you think?\\n\\nDo you consider them to be strong\\npartners?\\n\\nDo you think of them as fun\\ncompanions?\\n\\nDepending on how you think, your\\nadventure's significance changes.", "STEVEN: Olá, {01}{05}!\\n\\nQuando você está numa aventura com\\nseus POKéMON, o que pensa?\\n\\nVocê considera fortes parceiros?\\n\\nVocê acha que sÃo divertidos\\ne companheiros?\\n\\nDependendo de como você pensa, sua\\ninfluência muda o curso da aventura."},
  {"g3:082b5db4", "STEVEN: Hello?\\n{01}{05}?\\n\\nI'm involved in a spot of trouble\\nat the SPACE CENTER.\\n\\nI'm sorry, but I can't talk now.\\nBye!", "STEVEN: Hello?\\n{01}{05}?\\n\\nI'm involved in a spot of trouble\\nat the SPACE CENTER.\\n\\nI'm sorry, but I can't talk now.\\nBye!"},
  {"g3:082b5e26", "STEVEN: Oh!\\n{01}{05}!\\n\\nThere's no need to talk.\\nIt's past time for talking.\\n\\nYou have to believe in yourself\\nand do what's right.", "STEVEN: Oh!\\n{01}{05}!\\n\\nNÃo temos nada para falar.\\nNÃo precisa de conselhos.\\n\\nTem que confiar em você e\\nfazer o que acha correto."},
  {"g3:082b5ea2", "... ... ... ... ... ...\\n\\nSTEVEN appears not to be getting\\nthe call...", "... ... ... ... ... ...\\n\\nSTEVEN parece nÃo estar vendo\\nsua ligaçÃo..."},
  {"g3:082b5ed9", "STEVEN: {01}{05}... Congratulations\\nfor entering the HALL OF FAME.\\n\\n... ... ... ... ... ...\\n... ... ... ... ... ...\\n\\nI hope we can meet again\\nsomewhere!", "STEVEN: {01}{05}... Parabéns\\npor entrar no HALL da FAMA.\\n\\n... ... ... ... ... ...\\n... ... ... ... ... ...\\n\\nEu espero que algum dia\\nvoltaremos a nos ver!"},
  {"g3:082b5f52", "PROF. BIRCH: Oh, {01}{05}!\\nI've already heard about you!\\n\\nIt seems your POKéNAV's been\\nupgraded with MATCH CALL.\\n\\nWell, I should register, too!\\n\\nThat way, I'd be able to examine\\nyour POKéDEX even while you're\\n\\nout in the field.\\n\\n... ... ... ... ... ...", "PROF. BIRCH: Oh, {01}{05}!\\nEu ouvi falar de você!\\n\\nParece que sua POKéNAV foi\\natualizada com «CHAMADA».\\n\\nBem, eu devo registrar, também!\\n\\nDessa forma, eu seria capaz de examinar\\nsuar POKéDEX mesmo quando você\\n\\nestiver pelos campos.\\n\\n... ... ... ..."},
  {"g3:082b603a", "Registered PROF. BIRCH\\nin the POKéNAV.", "Registrou PROF. BIRCH\\nna sua POKéNAV."},
  {"g3:082b60c0", "MR. STONE: Oh? {01}{05}!\\n\\nSince you called me, the POKéNAV\\nmust be working properly!\\n\\nOther people will be registered,\\nso try calling them up, too!\\n\\nGood! Good!\\nYou seem to be quite happy!\\n\\nHm...\\nHow could I know that?\\n\\nIt's because I'm looking down at\\nyou from my office window!\\n\\nWahahaha!\\nSee you again!", "MR. STONE: Oh? {01}{05}!\\n\\nDesde que você me ligou, a POKéNAV\\nestar funcionando corretamente.\\n\\nOutras pessoas serÃo registradas,\\ne podem te ligar também!\\n\\nBom!\\nVocê parece estar feliz!\\n\\nHum...\\nComo eu sei isso?\\n\\nÉ porque eu estou olhando para você\\nda minha janela do escritório.\\n\\nWahahaha!!\\nTe vejo depois!"},
  {"g3:082b61e6", "MR. STONE: Oh? {01}{05}!\\n\\nWhat's wrong? Have you forgotten\\nabout that little errand of mine?\\n\\nI need you to deliver my letter\\nto STEVEN in DEWFORD.\\n\\nAfter that, deliver our parcel to\\nCAPT. STERN in SLATEPORT.\\n\\nYou remember, don't you?\\n\\nNow, since I am a busy PRESIDENT,\\nI have to go! Bye-bye!", "MR. STONE: Oh? {01}{05}!\\n\\nO que há de errado? Esqueceu o meu\\npequeno recado?\\n\\nEu preciso que você entregue minha\\nCARTA para STEVEN em DEWFORD.\\n\\nDepois disso, entregar o PACOTE para\\nCAPT. STERN em SLATERPORT.\\n\\nVocê se lembra, nÃo é?\\n\\nAh... Sou um PRESIDENTE ocupado,\\nEu tenho que ir! Bye-bye!"},
  {"g3:082b6302", "MR. STONE: Oh! {01}{05}!\\n\\nAh, so you've met STEVEN!\\nI'd better reward you, then!\\n\\nWhen you visit RUSTBORO again,\\ncome see me at my office.\\n\\nI'll be waiting for you!", "MR. STONE: Oh! {01}{05}!\\n\\nAh, você encontrou STEVEN! \\nÉ melhor te recompensar.\\n\\nQuando visitar RUSTBORO de novo,\\nvenha ao meu escritório.\\n\\nVou esperar a sua visita!"},
  {"g3:082b63a0", "MR. STONE: Oh! {01}{05}!\\n\\nDid you know that DEVON was\\ndigging the RUSTURF TUNNEL?\\n\\nBut we shut down the operation to\\nprotect the POKéMON in the area.\\n\\nIt's a no-brainer, really.\\n\\nIt's more important to let POKéMON\\nlive in peace than worry about our\\n\\nown convenience.", "MR. STONE: Oh! {01}{05}!\\n\\nDid you know that DEVON was\\ndigging the RUSTURF TUNNEL?\\n\\nBut we shut down the operation to\\nprotect the POKéMON in the area.\\n\\nIt's a no-brainer, really.\\n\\nIt's more important to let POKéMON\\nlive in peace than worry about our\\n\\nown convenience."},
  {"g3:082b64a2", "MR. STONE: Hello, hello, {01}{05}!\\n\\nI heard from someone in PETALBURG\\nthat you're NORMAN's child!\\n\\nNo wonder you're such a capable\\nbeing!", "MR. STONE: Olá, olá, {01}{05}!\\n\\nEu ouvi de alguém em PETALBURG\\nque você é filho(a) de NORMAN!\\n\\nNÃo é à toa que você\\né tÃo capaz assim!"},
  {"g3:082b6526", "MR. STONE: What's that?\\n\\nYou battled your own father and\\ndefeated him?\\n\\nThat's astounding!\\n\\nI had no idea that I befriended\\nsomeone so special! Wahaha!", "MR. STONE: O que é isso?\\n\\nVocê lutou contra seu próprio\\npai e o derrotou?\\n\\nÉ surpreendente!\\n\\nEu nÃo tinha idéia em ter amizade\\ncom alguém tÃo especial!"},
  {"g3:082b65bb", "Hello!\\nThis is DEVON CORPORATI...\\n\\nOh, hello, {01}!\\n\\nOur PRESIDENT was here a little\\nwhile ago, but he's gone out.\\n\\nOur PRESIDENT is busy, but you\\nseem to be just as busy, {01}.", "Alô!\\nAqui é DEVON CORPORAÇÃ...\\n\\nOh, olá, {01}!\\n\\nO nosso PRESIDENTE estava aqui\\nfaz pouco tempo, mas ele saiu.\\n\\nNosso PRESIDENTE é ocupado, e você\\n{01} parece que também está."},
  {"g3:082b6664", "...Huh? ...What's that?\\n\\nGROU... Yes? ...DON?\\n\\nYou're breaking up...\\n...can't hear...\\n\\nBZZZZ...", "...Huh? ...Como?\\n\\nGROU... Sim? ...DON?\\n\\nEstá falhando...\\nEh... nÃo te escuto bem...\\n\\nBZZZZZZ..."},
  {"g3:082b66b1", "...Huh? ...What's that?\\n\\nSeaflo... Yes? ...Caver...?\\n\\nYou're breaking up...\\n...can't hear...\\n\\nBZZZZ...", "...Huh? ...Como?\\n\\nCAVERN... O que? ...DUME...?\\n\\nEstá falhando...\\nEh... nÃo te escuto bem...\\n\\nBZZZZZ..."},
  {"g3:082b6703", "MR. STONE: {01}{05}! It's me!\\n\\nYou were apparently involved in all\\nsorts of things, but I, being busy,\\n\\nhaven't a clue exactly what!\\n\\nHowever, I urge you to take\\nthe road you believe in and walk it.\\n\\nI'll always be in your corner!\\nTake care!", "MR. STONE: {01}{05}! sou eu!\\n\\nSei que tem feito muitas coisas, mas\\neu também estou ocupado, e nÃo sei\\n\\nexatamente o que deveria fazer!\\n\\nDe qualquer forma, escolha o\\ncaminho que considere melhor.\\n\\nEu vou te apoiar sempre!\\nCuide-se! Tchau!"},
  {"g3:082b67ed", "MR. STONE: ... ... ... ... ... ...\\nIs this maybe {01}{05}?\\n\\nYour voice is so full of confidence,\\nI didn't recognize you right off!\\n\\nHm! You must come visit us at DEVON\\nsometime!", "MR. STONE: Mmm...\\n{01}{05}? É você?\\n\\nSua voz transmite uma segurança\\ne confiança...\\n\\nNÃo reconheci imediatamente!\\n\\nAo passar as vezes pela DEVON\\ntem que vim nos visitar!"},
  {"g3:082c427c", "BLEND MASTER: Indeed I am!\\nThe BLEND MASTER am I!\\n\\nBlend with me, and you shall witness\\nthe mastery I bring to blending!", "BLEND MASTER: Indeed I am!\\nThe BLEND MASTER am I!\\n\\nBlend with me, and you shall witness\\nthe mastery I bring to blending!"},
  {"g3:082c42f4", "BLEND MASTER: Hmmm! So, you wish to\\nsee my mastery in action?", "BLEND MASTER: Hmmm! So, you wish to\\nsee my mastery in action?"},
  {"g3:082c4332", "Hmmm!\\n\\nSo, you are too busy now, I see!\\n\\nBut fear not!\\nI shall be here all day!\\n\\nHurry back from your errand!", "Hmmm!\\n\\nSo, you are too busy now, I see!\\n\\nBut fear not!\\nI shall be here all day!\\n\\nHurry back from your errand!"},
  {"g3:082c439d", "Hmmm!\\n\\nYou haven't got a single BERRY!\\n\\nI shall be here all day!\\nHurry back with some BERRIES!", "Hmmm!\\n\\nYou haven't got a single BERRY!\\n\\nI shall be here all day!\\nHurry back with some BERRIES!"},
  {"g3:082c43fa", "Of course!\\nOf course!\\n\\nIncidentally...\\nYou do know how to blend POKéBLOCKS\\n\\nfrom BERRIES?", "Of course!\\nOf course!\\n\\nIncidentally...\\nYou do know how to blend POKéBLOCKS\\n\\nfrom BERRIES?"},
  {"g3:082c444c", "Hmmm!\\n\\nAh, but it is a simple process!\\n\\nWhen the BLENDER's arrow comes to\\nyour marker, just press the A Button.\\n\\nThat's all you have to do.\\n\\nWhen you see how precisely I press\\nthe A Button, you will understand.", "Hmmm!\\n\\nAh, but it is a simple process!\\n\\nWhen the BLENDER's arrow comes to\\nyour marker, just press the A Button.\\n\\nThat's all you have to do.\\n\\nWhen you see how precisely I press\\nthe A Button, you will understand."},
  {"g3:082c451b", "Fine!\\n\\nLet's get started, then!\\n\\nAll together with the BLEND MASTER,\\nlet's BERRY BLENDER!", "Fine!\\n\\nLet's get started, then!\\n\\nAll together with the BLEND MASTER,\\nlet's BERRY BLENDER!"},
  {"g3:082c4573", "Hmmm!\\n\\nYou don't appear to have gotten\\nthe POKéBLOCK CASE!\\n\\nI shall be here all day!\\nObtain the POKéBLOCK CASE and hurry back!", "Hmmm!\\n\\nYou don't appear to have gotten\\nthe POKéBLOCK CASE!\\n\\nI shall be here all day!\\nObtain the POKéBLOCK CASE and hurry back!"},
  {"g3:082c45e8", "Hmmm!\\n\\nYour POKéBLOCK CASE appears to be full!\\n\\nI shall be here all day!\\nUse some POKéBLOCKS and hurry back!", "Hmmm!\\n\\nYour POKéBLOCK CASE appears to be full!\\n\\nI shall be here all day!\\nUse some POKéBLOCKS and hurry back!"},
  {"g3:082c464b", "Whoa!\\nAwesome!", "Whoa!\\nAwesome!"},
